    "description": "Tavern / food hall, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 564 blocks vs 345 (first build 418 vs 280). Long timber food hall: one long table with benches under a dormer, a big brick hearth and chimney at the far end, a kitchen corner (smoker) by a side door and a bar of kegs. L2 adds function: an outdoor kitchen under a lean-to (second smoker, prep table, supplies), a serving hatch and a table for two, plus sign, lanterns, chandeliers and banners. L3 adds a bread oven, a storeroom shed and a beer-garden terrace (extra dining), plus candles and flower boxes. Not yet builder-tested: oak_hanging_sign, red_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, sign_text.",
    "changes": "Carlton: each level must also add function. L2 now adds a bigger kitchen (an outdoor kitchen under a lean-to by the kitchen door with a second smoker, a prep table and a supply barrel), a serving hatch between kitchen and hall, and a table for two. L3 adds a brick bread oven opening into the outdoor kitchen and a storeroom shed (barrels, chest, potatoes) behind the beer-garden terrace (the extra dining area). Quality check: the chimney now rises to the top of the ridge; the flower boxes have trapdoor ends. The decorations of v1 are kept.",
